WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:02.845
- I literally feel like
I'm just eating cold vomit.

00:00:02.845 --> 00:00:05.045
(gags and coughs)

00:00:05.045 --> 00:00:07.712
(playful music)

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.943
- I've tried a little bit of baby food.

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:13.265
I feel like applesauce
is pretty much baby food.

00:00:13.265 --> 00:00:15.273
(laughs)
- I've consumed baby food

00:00:15.273 --> 00:00:19.383
secondhand, as my baby
vomited it into my mouth.

00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:20.451
- Oh my goodness!

00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:22.831
- I bought baby food in April,

00:00:22.831 --> 00:00:25.536
because I wanted to eat it.

00:00:25.536 --> 00:00:28.091
- Most of it grosses
me out, and then I feel

00:00:28.091 --> 00:00:31.508
really guilty about giving it to my kids.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:37.410
Summer Vegetable Delight
is a wonderful name.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.309
- It looks like my cat's vomit.

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:41.004
- Smells like cornbread.

00:00:41.004 --> 00:00:42.217
- Is that what you call it?

00:00:42.217 --> 00:00:44.217
(sighs)

00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:47.128
- Oh my God, that's awful.

00:00:47.128 --> 00:00:47.961
- No it's bad.

00:00:47.961 --> 00:00:48.884
I think it tastes like dog food.

00:00:48.884 --> 00:00:49.717
Is it dog food?

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:51.963
- I taste squash, or
zucchini, or something.

00:00:51.963 --> 00:00:53.566
- It tastes like smashed-up peas,

00:00:53.566 --> 00:00:57.989
and preservatives, and
maybe there's carrot in it.

00:00:57.989 --> 00:01:00.156
- Mnh-Mnh, no, not for me.

00:01:02.726 --> 00:01:07.219
- It's super creamy, shiny,
it looks like a banana color.

00:01:07.219 --> 00:01:11.386
- The texture and consistency
are very pudding-like.

00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:13.802
- It's really sweet.

00:01:13.802 --> 00:01:15.236
It's surprisingly sweet.

00:01:15.236 --> 00:01:16.693
- Oh my God!

00:01:16.693 --> 00:01:18.045
This is terrible.

00:01:18.045 --> 00:01:19.473
(laughs)
- I love it.

00:01:19.473 --> 00:01:20.872
I would eat this as an adult.

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:22.800
- It's creeping me out
that I'm eating baby food,

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.633
but I guess it's good.

00:01:28.959 --> 00:01:31.240
- I've never eaten sweet
potato with chicken before,

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.073
I don't think.

00:01:32.073 --> 00:01:32.906
Is that a weird combo?

00:01:32.906 --> 00:01:35.112
- There's some spots.

00:01:35.112 --> 00:01:36.877
- I'm wondering if they
put cinnamon or nutmeg

00:01:36.877 --> 00:01:39.692
inside of it, or something to spice it up.

00:01:39.692 --> 00:01:41.735
- I don't think babies are into spice.

00:01:41.735 --> 00:01:44.063
- I don't know what they do to
it, to make it so disgusting.

00:01:44.063 --> 00:01:46.664
'Cause just a sweet potato
tastes better than this.

00:01:46.664 --> 00:01:48.614
- This tastes like straight-up squash,

00:01:48.614 --> 00:01:50.948
and therefore, I don't
want to eat anymore.

00:01:50.948 --> 00:01:52.823
'Cause there's chicken in
there, and I can't taste it,

00:01:52.823 --> 00:01:54.906
and it's freakin' me out.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:00.044
- This definitely looks
like traditional baby food.

00:02:00.044 --> 00:02:02.285
- It looks like a giant's booger.

00:02:02.285 --> 00:02:05.060
- Maybe this is the
reason why kids don't like

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.227
green foods, because they're
introduced in this manner.

00:02:10.278 --> 00:02:11.764
- Oh God!

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.847
- Green beans are already
kind of a soggy vegetable,

00:02:14.847 --> 00:02:15.990
- Yeah.
- And this is

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.651
just to the extreme.

00:02:17.651 --> 00:02:19.735
- My diet this way--
- I am not a fan

00:02:19.735 --> 00:02:21.290
of this at all.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.933
- It's not a fan of you either.

00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:24.036
- Okay, you can have it.

00:02:24.036 --> 00:02:26.703
(laughs)
Gross.

00:02:28.744 --> 00:02:30.665
- It was more bland than
I thought it would be.

00:02:30.665 --> 00:02:33.568
- Maybe this is the reason why
kids are such picky eaters,

00:02:33.568 --> 00:02:37.411
because they're fed such
bland, disgusting foods.

00:02:37.411 --> 00:02:39.309
- They're just so tasteless,

00:02:39.309 --> 00:02:40.743
but at the same time, disgusting.

00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:41.851
It's really confusing.

00:02:41.851 --> 00:02:43.651
- Just a tiny bit of hot sauce

00:02:43.651 --> 00:02:44.818
in some of those
(laughs)

00:02:44.818 --> 00:02:46.907
would make all the
difference in the world.

00:02:46.907 --> 00:02:48.039
- He couldn't swallow it.

00:02:48.039 --> 00:02:48.872
- I couldn't.

00:02:48.872 --> 00:02:51.041
I could not swallow it.

00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:52.968
- I didn't eat as much as him. (laughs)

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:53.897
I still have some left.

00:02:53.897 --> 00:02:55.814
- I did a big spoonful.

